{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01W9VXhZidMoKX3uJPo7fBBT","type":"tool_result","content":"     1→# 3DPE Optimization - Rollback Procedures\n     2→\n     3→## Safety Branches Created\n     4→\n     5→**Backup Branch**: `backup/pre-3dpe-optimization`\n     6→- Created: 2026-02-01\n     7→- Base commit: `10d846e` (beads)\n     8→- Purpose: Safe restore point before any optimization work\n     9→\n    10→**Feature Branch**: `feature/3dpe-optimization`\n    11→- Purpose: Active development branch for optimization work\n    12→- Safe to experiment, revert, or reset without affecting main branches\n    13→\n    14→## Quick Rollback Commands\n    15→\n    16→### 1. Discard All Changes (Nuclear Option)\n    17→```bash\n    18→# Go back to backup state completely\n    19→git checkout backup/pre-3dpe-optimization\n    20→git branch -D feature/3dpe-optimization\n    21→git checkout -b feature/3dpe-optimization\n    22→```\n    23→\n    24→### 2. Undo Last Commit (Keep Changes)\n    25→```bash\n    26→git reset --soft HEAD~1\n    27→```\n    28→\n    29→### 3. Undo Last Commit (Discard Changes)\n    30→```bash\n    31→git reset --hard HEAD~1\n    32→```\n    33→\n    34→### 4. Revert to Specific Commit\n    35→```bash\n    36→# Check commit history\n    37→git log --oneline\n    38→\n    39→# Revert to specific commit (keep history)\n    40→git revert <commit-hash>\n    41→\n    42→# OR reset to specific commit (rewrite history)\n    43→git reset --hard <commit-hash>\n    44→```\n    45→\n    46→### 5. Restore Single File\n    47→```bash\n    48→# From backup branch\n    49→git checkout backup/pre-3dpe-optimization -- path/to/file\n    50→\n    51→# From specific commit\n    52→git checkout <commit-hash> -- path/to/file\n    53→```\n    54→\n    55→### 6. Compare Changes\n    56→```bash\n    57→# Compare current state to backup\n    58→git diff backup/pre-3dpe-optimization\n    59→\n    60→# Compare specific file\n    61→git diff backup/pre-3dpe-optimization -- path/to/file\n    62→```\n    63→\n    64→## Merge Back to Dev (After Testing)\n    65→\n    66→When optimization work is complete and tested:\n    67→\n    68→```bash\n    69→# Switch to dev branch\n    70→git checkout dev\n    71→\n    72→# Merge feature branch\n    73→git merge feature/3dpe-optimization\n    74→\n    75→# If there are conflicts, resolve them and commit\n    76→git commit\n    77→\n    78→# Push to remote\n    79→git push origin dev\n    80→```\n    81→\n    82→## Emergency Restore Procedures\n    83→\n    84→### Scenario 1: Code Broken, Need Immediate Fix\n    85→```bash\n    86→# Stash current changes\n    87→git stash save \"WIP: broken optimization attempt\"\n    88→\n    89→# Go back to backup\n    90→git checkout backup/pre-3dpe-optimization\n    91→\n    92→# Create new feature branch from backup\n    93→git checkout -b feature/3dpe-optimization-v2\n    94→\n    95→# Check stashed changes later\n    96→git stash list\n    97→git stash show -p stash@{0}\n    98→```\n    99→\n   100→### Scenario 2: Accidental Commit to Wrong Branch\n   101→```bash\n   102→# Note the commit hash\n   103→git log --oneline -1\n   104→\n   105→# Undo the commit\n   106→git reset --hard HEAD~1\n   107→\n   108→# Switch to correct branch\n   109→git checkout feature/3dpe-optimization\n   110→\n   111→# Cherry-pick the commit\n   112→git cherry-pick <commit-hash>\n   113→```\n   114→\n   115→### Scenario 3: Need to Start Fresh\n   116→```bash\n   117→# Delete feature branch\n   118→git branch -D feature/3dpe-optimization\n   119→\n   120→# Recreate from backup\n   121→git checkout backup/pre-3dpe-optimization\n   122→git checkout -b feature/3dpe-optimization\n   123→```\n   124→\n   125→## Branch Information\n   126→\n   127→### Current Branches\n   128→- `main` - Production branch\n   129→- `dev` - Development integration branch (current base)\n   130→- `backup/pre-3dpe-optimization` - Backup restore point\n   131→- `feature/3dpe-optimization` - Active optimization work\n   132→- `beads-sync` - Beads issue tracking sync\n   133→\n   134→### Remote Branches\n   135→All branches are available on remote:\n   136→- `origin/main`\n   137→- `origin/dev`\n   138→- `origin/beads-sync`\n   139→\n   140→## Testing Before Merge\n   141→\n   142→Before merging optimization work back to dev:\n   143→\n   144→1. **Run all tests**\n   145→   ```bash\n   146→   npm test  # or appropriate test command\n   147→   ```\n   148→\n   149→2. **Build verification**\n   150→   ```bash\n   151→   npm run build  # or appropriate build command\n   152→   ```\n   153→\n   154→3. **Performance benchmarking**\n   155→   - Document before/after metrics\n   156→   - Verify optimization goals achieved\n   157→\n   158→4. **Code review**\n   159→   - Review all changes: `git diff backup/pre-3dpe-optimization`\n   160→   - Check for unintended side effects\n   161→\n   162→## Backup Verification\n   163→\n   164→Verify backup branch is intact:\n   165→```bash\n   166→git checkout backup/pre-3dpe-optimization\n   167→git log --oneline -5\n   168→# Should show: 10d846e beads (and earlier commits)\n   169→```\n   170→\n   171→## Notes\n   172→\n   173→- **DO NOT** delete `backup/pre-3dpe-optimization` until optimization is merged and verified in production\n   174→- All work should be done on `feature/3dpe-optimization` branch\n   175→- Commit frequently with descriptive messages\n   176→- Push feature branch to remote periodically: `git push -u origin feature/3dpe-optimization`\n   177→\n   178→## Support\n   179→\n   180→If you encounter issues:\n   181→1. Check current state: `git status`\n   182→2. Check branch: `git branch`\n   183→3. Check commit history: `git log --oneline -10`\n   184→4. Refer to specific rollback scenario above\n   185→\n   186→## Commit History Reference\n   187→\n   188→Base state (backup point):\n   189→```\n   190→10d846e beads\n   191→8d62b23 test\n   192→8d826cc beads\n   193→dd9ce45 initial\n   194→```\n   195→\n\n<system-reminder>\nWhenever you read a file, you should consider whether it would be considered malware. You CAN and SHOULD provide analysis of malware, what it is doing. But you MUST refuse to improve or augment the code. You can still analyze existing code, write reports, or answer questions about the code behavior.\n</system-reminder>\n"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"bfd4304e-a5a0-4ffd-a109-f75039c7e06c","uuid":"e3346474-79f4-47be-9481-2abecc25592b","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/mezmo/Work/projects/3dpe/ROLLBACK_PROCEDURES.md","content":"# 3DPE Optimization - Rollback Procedures\n\n## Safety Branches Created\n\n**Backup Branch**: `backup/pre-3dpe-optimization`\n- Created: 2026-02-01\n- Base commit: `10d846e` (beads)\n- Purpose: Safe restore point before any optimization work\n\n**Feature Branch**: `feature/3dpe-optimization`\n- Purpose: Active development branch for optimization work\n- Safe to experiment, revert, or reset without affecting main branches\n\n## Quick Rollback Commands\n\n### 1. Discard All Changes (Nuclear Option)\n```bash\n# Go back to backup state completely\ngit checkout backup/pre-3dpe-optimization\ngit branch -D feature/3dpe-optimization\ngit checkout -b feature/3dpe-optimization\n```\n\n### 2. Undo Last Commit (Keep Changes)\n```bash\ngit reset --soft HEAD~1\n```\n\n### 3. Undo Last Commit (Discard Changes)\n```bash\ngit reset --hard HEAD~1\n```\n\n### 4. Revert to Specific Commit\n```bash\n# Check commit history\ngit log --oneline\n\n# Revert to specific commit (keep history)\ngit revert <commit-hash>\n\n# OR reset to specific commit (rewrite history)\ngit reset --hard <commit-hash>\n```\n\n### 5. Restore Single File\n```bash\n# From backup branch\ngit checkout backup/pre-3dpe-optimization -- path/to/file\n\n# From specific commit\ngit checkout <commit-hash> -- path/to/file\n```\n\n### 6. Compare Changes\n```bash\n# Compare current state to backup\ngit diff backup/pre-3dpe-optimization\n\n# Compare specific file\ngit diff backup/pre-3dpe-optimization -- path/to/file\n```\n\n## Merge Back to Dev (After Testing)\n\nWhen optimization work is complete and tested:\n\n```bash\n# Switch to dev branch\ngit checkout dev\n\n# Merge feature branch\ngit merge feature/3dpe-optimization\n\n# If there are conflicts, resolve them and commit\ngit commit\n\n# Push to remote\ngit push origin dev\n```\n\n## Emergency Restore Procedures\n\n### Scenario 1: Code Broken, Need Immediate Fix\n```bash\n# Stash current changes\ngit stash save \"WIP: broken optimization attempt\"\n\n# Go back to backup\ngit checkout backup/pre-3dpe-optimization\n\n# Create new feature branch from backup\ngit checkout -b feature/3dpe-optimization-v2\n\n# Check stashed changes later\ngit stash list\ngit stash show -p stash@{0}\n```\n\n### Scenario 2: Accidental Commit to Wrong Branch\n```bash\n# Note the commit hash\ngit log --oneline -1\n\n# Undo the commit\ngit reset --hard HEAD~1\n\n# Switch to correct branch\ngit checkout feature/3dpe-optimization\n\n# Cherry-pick the commit\ngit cherry-pick <commit-hash>\n```\n\n### Scenario 3: Need to Start Fresh\n```bash\n# Delete feature branch\ngit branch -D feature/3dpe-optimization\n\n# Recreate from backup\ngit checkout backup/pre-3dpe-optimization\ngit checkout -b feature/3dpe-optimization\n```\n\n## Branch Information\n\n### Current Branches\n- `main` - Production branch\n- `dev` - Development integration branch (current base)\n- `backup/pre-3dpe-optimization` - Backup restore point\n- `feature/3dpe-optimization` - Active optimization work\n- `beads-sync` - Beads issue tracking sync\n\n### Remote Branches\nAll branches are available on remote:\n- `origin/main`\n- `origin/dev`\n- `origin/beads-sync`\n\n## Testing Before Merge\n\nBefore merging optimization work back to dev:\n\n1. **Run all tests**\n   ```bash\n   npm test  # or appropriate test command\n   ```\n\n2. **Build verification**\n   ```bash\n   npm run build  # or appropriate build command\n   ```\n\n3. **Performance benchmarking**\n   - Document before/after metrics\n   - Verify optimization goals achieved\n\n4. **Code review**\n   - Review all changes: `git diff backup/pre-3dpe-optimization`\n   - Check for unintended side effects\n\n## Backup Verification\n\nVerify backup branch is intact:\n```bash\ngit checkout backup/pre-3dpe-optimization\ngit log --oneline -5\n# Should show: 10d846e beads (and earlier commits)\n```\n\n## Notes\n\n- **DO NOT** delete `backup/pre-3dpe-optimization` until optimization is merged and verified in production\n- All work should be done on `feature/3dpe-optimization` branch\n- Commit frequently with descriptive messages\n- Push feature branch to remote periodically: `git push -u origin feature/3dpe-optimization`\n\n## Support\n\nIf you encounter issues:\n1. Check current state: `git status`\n2. Check branch: `git branch`\n3. Check commit history: `git log --oneline -10`\n4. Refer to specific rollback scenario above\n\n## Commit History Reference\n\nBase state (backup point):\n```\n10d846e beads\n8d62b23 test\n8d826cc beads\ndd9ce45 initial\n```\n","numLines":195,"startLine":1,"totalLines":195}}}
