e dependency analysis document\n- ✅ Categorized all dependencies by type and risk\n- ✅ Identified major version changes and breaking changes\n- ✅ Created 6-batch upgrade plan with version targets\n- ✅ Documented rollback procedures reference\n- ✅ Code committed and pushed to remote\n- ✅ Beads issue 3dpe-ak9.1 closed\n\n### 🎯 Key Recommendations\n\n1. **Target React 18** (not 19) - More stable, ecosystem mature\n2. **Use R3F v8.17.10** - Compatible with React 18 + Three.js 0.133+\n3. **Upgrade to Three.js 0.160** initially, then 0.182 in final phase\n4. **Add testing infrastructure** before upgrading to newer versions\n5. **Defer React 19** - Released too recently, ecosystem still catching up\n\n### 📁 Next Steps Available\n\nThe following user stories are now unblocked and ready to work on:\n- US-003: Upgrade framework dependencies (React 18 + R3F 8)\n- US-004: Upgrade build tool dependencies\n- US-005: Upgrade testing dependencies\n- US-006: Upgrade linting and formatting dependencies\n- US-007: Upgrade type definition dependencies\n- US-008: Upgrade utility and remaining dependencies\n\n<promise>COMPLETE</promise>"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":5,"cache_creation_input_tokens":506,"cache_read_input_tokens":41559,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":506},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"bfd4304e-a5a0-4ffd-a109-f75039c7e06c","uuid":"fdb6d8cb-bc4f-404f-8692-c1a5fc53be6a"}
